w-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Incorrect.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Incorrect.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"margin-top:0.7em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:bold\">This page may contain <i>missing</i> or <i>inaccurate</i> information!</span><br />\n</p><p><span>Certain information in this page is missing or may contain inaccurate information. If you can cite where this particular information comes from, please add a citation - especially with percent calculations! The list following this notice denotes important potential inaccuracies and omissions.\n</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Scorpions are a very rare mob only found in the deserts of Ferwater. They mostly fall into a ravine in the desert, where you can find and catch them. They can also be disabled with the creepy crawly setting.\n</p><p>The only way to catch a scorpion is by using the Bug Net or the Bug Catcher 3000, which are purchasable in <a href=\"/wiki/Flora_Laura\" title=\"Flora Laura\">Flora Laura</a> Shop. They can be sold at the Resource Hub.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\">Variants</span></h2>\n<p>WIP\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163605\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 23/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1230/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.427      1 -total\n 71.90%    3.902      1 Template:Under_Construction\n 26.96%    1.463      1 Template:Missing_Info\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:5